# F4 (RRORD-101) compute node: Wiwynn SV7220G3 Tioga Pass, 2x Xeon Gold 6138, 128 GB (4x32 GB),
# OCP MCX4411A 1x25G + a PCIe 2x25G NIC from any card vendor (seen: HPE 640SFP28, Mellanox MCX4121A),
# system storage = one 250/256 GB M.2 2280 NVMe, any vendor.
# Authored 2026-10-27 from et8b2/et24b2/et26b2 inventories; HPE/SN850 de-pinned per operator same day.
# No Ava rule: 3 of 4 F4 blades have no Ava FRU. Presence-only grammar: an extra HBA is not flagged here.
# NVMe rule: macinv gives PCIe drives a "SubVendor: pci" (SATA drives carry "Revision:"), capacity in
# GiB, so 250 GB reads 232 and 256 GB reads 238. M.2 2280 form factor is not visible in inventory.
'BIOS Version: TPO_P26F'
'Chassis Serial: C\.M\.B60\.00X1C'
'Board Mfg: Wistron, Product: Tioga ?Pass'
'^2 Processor.*Intel.*Gold 6138.*2.00GHz'
'^4 Memory Size: 32 GB'
'^1 Model:.*MCX4411A-ACQN'
'^2 Model:.*(ConnectX-4 Lx|ConnectX-5|25G|XXV710|E810|BCM5741[24])'
'^1 Model: "[^"]*", SubVendor: pci .*Capacity: 23[2-9] GB'
